It is an independent implementation of the "LLM wiki" pattern described by
Andrej Karpathy:
https://gist.github.com/karpathy/442a6bf555914893e9891c11519de94f

It can optionally send documents to a LightRAG instance
(https://github.com/HKUDS/LightRAG), run alone or managed with Coeos-RAG
(https://github.com/Odyssai-eu/Coeos-RAG). Both are separate projects under
their own licenses and are not distributed here.
